Terraform Variables Demonstration
==================================

PROJECT CONFIGURATION
--------------------
Project Name: ${project_name}
Environment: ${environment}
Timestamp: ${timestamp}

INFRASTRUCTURE SETTINGS
----------------------
Instance Count: ${instance_count}
Server Name: ${server_name}
Port Number: ${port}
Custom Domain: ${custom_domain != null ? custom_domain : "Not configured"}

FEATURE FLAGS
------------
Monitoring Enabled: ${monitoring}
Debug Mode: ${debug_enabled}
Backups Enabled: ${backups_enabled}
SSL Enabled: ${ssl_enabled}
Backup Retention: ${backup_retention != null ? "${backup_retention} days" : "Not configured"}

AVAILABILITY ZONES
-----------------
Total Zones: ${zone_count}
Primary Zone: ${primary_zone}
All Zones: ${join(", ", zones)}

ALLOWED IP ADDRESSES
-------------------
${join("\n", allowed_ips)}

TAGS
----
%{ for key, value in tags ~}
${key}: ${value}
%{ endfor ~}

DATABASE CONFIGURATION
---------------------
Engine: ${db_config.engine}
Version: ${db_config.version}
Port: ${db_config.port}
Backup: ${db_config.backup}
Replicas: ${db_config.replicas}

SERVER CONFIGURATIONS
--------------------
%{ for server in server_configs ~}
${server.name}:
  - Size: ${server.size}
  - Role: ${server.role}
%{ endfor ~}

COMPUTED VALUES (LOCALS)
-----------------------
Resource Prefix: ${resource_prefix}
Instance Type: ${instance_type}

